{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17340","headline":"酬冯监拜昭陵回途中遇雨见示 · 权德舆","name":"酬冯监拜昭陵回途中遇雨见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"之子共乘轺，清秋拜上霄。\n曙霞迎夙驾，零雨湿回镳。\n甘谷行初尽，轩台去渐遥。\n望中犹可辨，耘鸟下山椒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}